WEBVTT

00:01:44.890 --> 00:01:47.880
Yay! It's so fun!

00:01:50.930 --> 00:01:51.780
It's done!

00:01:53.120 --> 00:01:55.650
Princess, it's time for the ball.

00:01:56.400 --> 00:01:57.800
It's time to go.

00:01:58.390 --> 00:02:01.380
In that case, could you get my dress for me?

00:02:01.820 --> 00:02:02.890
Your dress?

00:02:03.220 --> 00:02:04.790
We don't have one.

00:02:05.620 --> 00:02:10.580
What?  I can't go to the ball if I don't have a dress.

00:02:10.970 --> 00:02:12.610
Okay, how about we wrap this around you?

00:02:14.180 --> 00:02:15.560
What?

00:02:15.770 --> 00:02:18.680
I can't meet my prince wearing this.

00:02:19.180 --> 00:02:20.280
Prince?

00:02:20.580 --> 00:02:24.790
Of course.  When a princess goes to the ball, she must meet her prince.

00:02:29.840 --> 00:02:32.530
That's right, my prince...

00:02:38.380 --> 00:02:39.610
It's a landslide!

00:02:40.100 --> 00:02:41.250
Great!  Great!

00:02:45.190 --> 00:02:49.290
What?  Yuzuyu-chan, your smock.   Smock!

00:02:50.720 --> 00:02:53.640
Shouldn't we do something about Yuzuyu-chan's uniform?

00:02:53.890 --> 00:02:58.000
Well, we still have to talk to Katakura-san about it.

00:02:58.450 --> 00:03:03.080
I guess so, but she may be transferring again soon...

00:03:03.660 --> 00:03:04.690
Yes, that's true...

00:03:05.930 --> 00:03:07.780
Calm down, let's put this on properly.

00:03:08.230 --> 00:03:09.860
Your clothes are going to get dirty.

00:03:20.770 --> 00:03:21.720
Marika-chan?

00:03:31.820 --> 00:03:33.250
Marika-chan, what is it?

00:03:37.990 --> 00:03:39.110
Marika-chan?

00:03:39.210 --> 00:03:41.200
Yuzuyu-chan...

00:03:41.530 --> 00:03:44.410
How come you're the only one wearing a different uniform?

00:03:45.330 --> 00:03:46.190
Uniform?

00:03:46.410 --> 00:03:49.320
See, it's different from everyone else's.

00:03:52.180 --> 00:03:54.600
Maybe it doesn't matter what kind of uniform you wear.

00:03:55.760 --> 00:03:57.460
You should be quiet...

00:04:00.500 --> 00:04:03.340
Maybe she's a show-off.

00:04:04.000 --> 00:04:05.340
Oh, I see...

00:04:05.990 --> 00:04:09.180
Yuzuyu-chan, you're a show-off.

00:04:10.330 --> 00:04:11.530
Show-off?

00:04:12.260 --> 00:04:14.100
Show-off!

00:04:14.360 --> 00:04:17.030
Yuzuyu-chan the show-off!

00:04:17.120 --> 00:04:27.950
Show-off!

00:04:28.430 --> 00:04:30.060
Quickly now, back to your rooms.

00:04:30.420 --> 00:04:32.010
Okay!

00:04:40.260 --> 00:04:41.360
Yuzuyu-chan...

00:05:18.540 --> 00:05:22.110
I didn't know they had these.

00:05:22.760 --> 00:05:24.790
What?  That's pretty expensive!

00:05:28.170 --> 00:05:29.820
Hello, Kuma-san.

00:05:30.500 --> 00:05:32.250
Hello, Usagi-san.

00:05:36.190 --> 00:05:37.960
I'm sure she will like them though.

00:05:43.540 --> 00:05:46.060
It's ground meat.  I should buy some.

00:05:49.760 --> 00:05:53.050
Pork or beef... which should I get?

00:05:53.450 --> 00:05:54.590
What are you doing?

00:05:56.960 --> 00:05:57.780
What are you doing here?

00:05:58.320 --> 00:06:00.400
I came to buy a CD-R.

00:06:01.400 --> 00:06:04.800
What are you doing in here, anyway?

00:06:05.250 --> 00:06:08.810
I was going to buy the ingredients to make some hamburgers...

00:06:09.740 --> 00:06:11.910
but I don't know which kind to buy.

00:06:12.340 --> 00:06:15.190
Oh, for that... you need the mixed meat.

00:06:16.090 --> 00:06:20.920
What?  I never knew there was an animal called a "mixed".

00:06:21.120 --> 00:06:23.980
No, it's a mix of beef and pork.

00:06:24.980 --> 00:06:25.670
Really?

00:06:26.090 --> 00:06:29.160
You didn't even know that and you've been making her lunches?

00:06:29.660 --> 00:06:30.160
Yeah.

00:06:31.550 --> 00:06:34.510
Yuzuyu-chan, what has he been making you eat?

00:06:36.490 --> 00:06:39.040
Goodbye, Sensei!

00:06:46.980 --> 00:06:48.110
It's me, Katakura.

00:06:48.280 --> 00:06:49.140
Yes!

00:06:51.760 --> 00:06:55.110
Excuse me, are you his younger brother?

00:06:55.910 --> 00:06:56.300
Yes.

00:06:57.080 --> 00:06:59.080
I see, you've come here together.

00:06:59.660 --> 00:07:01.470
I'll go get Yuzuyu-chan.

00:07:01.860 --> 00:07:04.020
Yuzuyu-chan!  You're being picked up.

00:07:08.430 --> 00:07:09.510
Kippei-san.

00:07:10.720 --> 00:07:12.260
Kippei-onii-chan!

00:07:12.810 --> 00:07:13.390
Yuzuyu!

00:07:16.630 --> 00:07:18.050
Today at preschool...

00:07:21.280 --> 00:07:22.870
I had lots of fun!

00:07:28.730 --> 00:07:31.220
I'm home!

00:07:31.990 --> 00:07:33.190
Welcome home!

00:07:33.700 --> 00:07:35.200
Oh, Satsuki, you're with them too?

00:07:35.490 --> 00:07:37.760
Yeah, I met them on the way home.

00:07:38.350 --> 00:07:39.760
I'm hungry...

00:07:40.130 --> 00:07:43.840
Oh yeah, can you put this in the fridge?

00:07:44.350 --> 00:07:47.390
Oh, mixed meat... How did you know?

00:07:48.500 --> 00:07:50.020
Well...

00:07:53.020 --> 00:07:56.920
Yuzuyu-chan, I'm going to start making dinner now, so go change out of your uniform.

00:08:02.200 --> 00:08:03.130
What's wrong?

00:08:13.370 --> 00:08:14.360
Did something happen?

00:08:15.150 --> 00:08:17.130
No, not that I've noticed.

00:08:27.330 --> 00:08:28.890
What are you looking at?

00:08:29.860 --> 00:08:30.800
Well...

00:08:31.520 --> 00:08:32.850
W-What is it?

00:08:33.460 --> 00:08:37.560
Why is Yuzuyu-chan the only one wearing a different uniform?

00:08:44.010 --> 00:08:45.570
Kippei!

00:08:45.570 --> 00:08:46.960
W-What?

00:08:47.610 --> 00:08:51.010
Has Yuzuyu-chan been wearing a different uniform from everyone else all this time?

00:08:52.080 --> 00:08:53.010
Uniform?

00:08:53.550 --> 00:08:57.030
Satsuki said that Yuzuyu-chan is the only one who has a different uniform.

00:08:57.130 --> 00:08:59.780
Uniform?  What are you talking about?

00:09:02.450 --> 00:09:03.090
Ouch!

00:09:06.380 --> 00:09:08.640
I didn't think it mattered.

00:09:09.400 --> 00:09:12.040
The preschool I went to didn't have a uniform, so...

00:09:12.170 --> 00:09:15.450
If her uniform is different from everyone else's, you should have noticed!

00:09:15.630 --> 00:09:17.630
Ah!  No more violence!

00:09:17.890 --> 00:09:22.010
Even if Yuzuyu-chan doesn't seem bothered by it, you really should have noticed!

00:09:22.560 --> 00:09:23.360
I see...

00:09:24.280 --> 00:09:27.570
That's why Yuzuyu didn't seem happy.

00:09:29.040 --> 00:09:30.070
But you know...

00:09:30.920 --> 00:09:31.530
What?

00:09:32.490 --> 00:09:36.900
Once Miyako comes back, she may have to go back to her old school.

00:09:38.600 --> 00:09:39.930
What do you mean?

00:09:40.580 --> 00:09:43.140
It means that even if you buy a new one, it may go to waste.

00:09:44.190 --> 00:09:45.760
That's not the problem.

00:09:45.980 --> 00:09:51.270
That's right... If Aunt Miyako comes back, Yuzuyu might even go home tomorrow.

00:09:59.170 --> 00:10:01.610
I would like an Asou Preschool uniform.  Please.

00:10:02.300 --> 00:10:03.450
Y-Yes.

00:10:05.610 --> 00:10:08.220
It's the same as everyone else's!

00:10:09.300 --> 00:10:11.050
It looks cute, Yuzu!

00:10:11.420 --> 00:10:13.310
Yeah, it looks good on you.

00:10:25.080 --> 00:10:25.910
Just add this...

00:10:27.890 --> 00:10:28.860
and we're finished!

00:10:29.670 --> 00:10:30.450
I'm awake!

00:10:31.060 --> 00:10:34.300
Okay, go wash your face and get dressed.

00:10:34.600 --> 00:10:35.120
Okay.

00:10:53.730 --> 00:10:54.480
What's wrong?

00:10:55.660 --> 00:10:57.510
We got this yesterday...

00:10:59.420 --> 00:11:01.580
Yeah, it's your new uniform.

00:11:02.200 --> 00:11:03.170
It's cute, isn't it?

00:11:10.000 --> 00:11:13.870
Yuzuyu-chan is going to wear her new uniform...

00:11:14.520 --> 00:11:16.930
I'm sure she'll look cute!

00:11:25.390 --> 00:11:26.240
Why?

00:11:27.720 --> 00:11:29.930
Good morning, Onee-sama.

00:11:31.800 --> 00:11:33.730
G-Good morning...

00:11:34.610 --> 00:11:35.530
Good morning.

00:11:37.280 --> 00:11:38.720
I want to talk to you for a second.

00:11:45.650 --> 00:11:47.150
What's the meaning of this?

00:11:47.390 --> 00:11:49.260
W-What is it?

00:11:49.410 --> 00:11:52.900
Why isn't she wearing the uniform I bought for her?

00:11:53.130 --> 00:11:54.440
Are you trying to antagonize me?

00:11:54.570 --> 00:11:57.280
N-No way, I wouldn't even dream of it.

00:11:57.650 --> 00:11:58.900
Then why?

00:11:59.160 --> 00:12:02.730
Yuzu said she wanted to wear her old one.

00:12:03.970 --> 00:12:05.130
Yuzuyu-chan said that...

00:12:19.070 --> 00:12:20.990
We're going!

00:12:32.020 --> 00:12:34.160
Reiko, you're going to be late.

00:12:34.780 --> 00:12:36.810
Why?  What is it?

00:12:38.280 --> 00:12:39.050
Why?

00:12:39.470 --> 00:12:40.820
What is it?

00:12:41.150 --> 00:12:43.240
Yuzuyu-chan!

00:12:49.740 --> 00:12:50.320
Hey...

00:12:54.040 --> 00:12:55.750
Why didn't you want to wear your new uniform?

00:13:18.520 --> 00:13:24.780
Sometimes transfer students feel uncomfortable if they don't have the same uniform as everyone else...

00:13:27.200 --> 00:13:30.790
But then why won't she wear her new uniform?

00:13:33.910 --> 00:13:35.200
I don't get it.

00:13:43.850 --> 00:13:46.290
Why would I stick with my old uniform?

00:13:47.950 --> 00:13:49.190
I don't really understand, but...

00:13:49.870 --> 00:13:52.660
maybe it has some sentimental value.

00:13:53.270 --> 00:13:54.240
Sentimental?

00:13:54.530 --> 00:13:56.340
I get it!  I get it!

00:13:56.910 --> 00:14:00.370
It's like the mail you have saved on your old cell phone: the ones that you can't replace.

00:14:00.990 --> 00:14:01.920
Kind of like that.

00:14:03.140 --> 00:14:03.960
Is that it?

00:14:04.580 --> 00:14:05.570
I'm not sure...

00:14:06.700 --> 00:14:08.390
but I have things like that too.

00:14:09.540 --> 00:14:10.980
I see...

00:14:12.340 --> 00:14:14.580
Maybe I wasn't delicate enough?

00:14:15.340 --> 00:14:17.760
What is it?  A new girl?

00:14:18.270 --> 00:14:20.230
Something like that...

00:14:20.990 --> 00:14:22.650
You're so suspicious.

00:14:44.250 --> 00:14:45.860
Now that I think about it, she really does stand out.

00:15:08.980 --> 00:15:13.120
Is there something that you really like about that uniform?

00:15:32.390 --> 00:15:34.930
You're going to wear this and go to preschool every day.

00:15:35.380 --> 00:15:36.390
Preschool?

00:15:36.770 --> 00:15:41.000
You're going to make a lot of friends at preschool.

00:15:41.920 --> 00:15:43.000
Really?

00:15:51.220 --> 00:15:53.200
What?  What's wrong?

00:16:00.500 --> 00:16:03.700
Mama bought me this.

00:16:07.130 --> 00:16:10.750
From Mama...

00:16:13.700 --> 00:16:16.600
I see, so that's why.

00:16:21.530 --> 00:16:22.550
Yuzuyu?

00:16:23.870 --> 00:16:24.490
Yuzuyu!

00:16:25.220 --> 00:16:25.750
Mama.

00:16:26.070 --> 00:16:27.900
I didn't know where you went...

00:16:28.510 --> 00:16:31.390
I asked you to wait for me in front of the store.

00:16:34.550 --> 00:16:36.700
I thought you had disappeared...

00:16:38.580 --> 00:16:43.910
But I saw your yellow hat from far away, so I ran to you.

00:16:46.520 --> 00:16:48.400
You shouldn't wander off on your own.

00:16:48.970 --> 00:16:52.010
I was only able to find you because of your uniform.

00:16:54.980 --> 00:16:56.790
So... so...

00:16:57.670 --> 00:16:58.830
If I'm not wearing this uniform,

00:16:59.630 --> 00:17:02.840
Mama won't be able to find me.

00:17:28.810 --> 00:17:30.200
That's not true.

00:17:33.000 --> 00:17:36.850
No matter what you're wearing, your mama will be able to find you.

00:17:37.370 --> 00:17:38.350
No matter what.

00:17:38.860 --> 00:17:39.510
Really?

00:17:40.080 --> 00:17:43.460
Yes, really.  She's your Mama.

00:17:44.070 --> 00:17:46.400
There's no way she wouldn't recognize you.

00:17:48.160 --> 00:17:50.440
She's known you since the day you were born.

00:17:52.510 --> 00:17:54.090
Even if you don't remember,

00:17:54.460 --> 00:17:56.870
your Mama remembers the day you were born.

00:17:57.340 --> 00:17:59.080
The day after you were born...

00:17:59.520 --> 00:18:00.510
and the day after that...

00:18:01.090 --> 00:18:02.960
and every day from then on...

00:18:03.340 --> 00:18:04.470
She remembers them all.

00:18:13.500 --> 00:18:15.660
I don't remember them.

00:18:18.130 --> 00:18:19.790
That's because you were a baby.

00:18:20.220 --> 00:18:21.870
Oh, I see!

00:18:22.850 --> 00:18:25.170
That's right.  Feeling any better?

00:18:25.580 --> 00:18:27.750
Yeah, a lot!

00:18:37.470 --> 00:18:39.640
I thought she would be happy...

00:18:40.170 --> 00:18:41.280
So what's wrong?

00:18:42.340 --> 00:18:45.180
Normally wouldn't you want to wear the same uniform as everyone else?

00:18:45.560 --> 00:18:47.260
Y-Yes.

00:18:48.060 --> 00:18:48.850
That's right.

00:18:49.430 --> 00:18:51.670
That must be it...

00:18:52.680 --> 00:18:54.320
Thank you for your hard work.

00:18:56.910 --> 00:19:00.580
Reiko-san's uniform is different from everyone else's...

00:19:00.940 --> 00:19:04.440
Yeah, she said she can't wear such a lame uniform.

00:19:04.840 --> 00:19:07.330
The manager can't do anything about it.

00:19:12.000 --> 00:19:13.660
I'm home...

00:19:16.170 --> 00:19:18.040
I'm really tired again, today.

00:19:18.240 --> 00:19:19.440
No!

00:19:19.630 --> 00:19:20.800
Bath-time!

00:19:20.960 --> 00:19:22.180
No!

00:19:22.870 --> 00:19:23.990
Yuzuyu!

00:19:24.430 --> 00:19:25.160
Kippei...

00:19:26.060 --> 00:19:26.570
Welcome home.

00:19:27.290 --> 00:19:29.230
Was Yuzuyu-chan just...

00:19:30.510 --> 00:19:31.230
Oh, yeah.

00:19:31.910 --> 00:19:32.950
Yuzuyu!

00:19:34.360 --> 00:19:34.400
Yep!

00:19:34.400 --> 00:19:35.150
Yes!
Yep!

00:19:35.650 --> 00:19:38.570
Wow, that looks great on you!

00:19:48.990 --> 00:19:50.490
But... why?

00:19:51.990 --> 00:19:53.060
Ah, the uniform?

00:19:55.390 --> 00:19:58.280
I'm going to put it away until Mama comes to get me.

00:19:59.810 --> 00:20:03.270
Yeah.  Let's keep it in here so you can get it out whenever you want.

00:20:04.180 --> 00:20:05.710
I can't reach it!

00:20:08.510 --> 00:20:09.250
I did it!

00:20:10.830 --> 00:20:11.490
Bye bye!

00:20:12.250 --> 00:20:12.980
See you again!

00:20:19.960 --> 00:20:21.230
Wear this one from now on, okay?

00:20:21.700 --> 00:20:22.120
Yeah!

00:20:26.470 --> 00:20:28.150
Oh, I see...

00:20:28.770 --> 00:20:32.630
She had a lot of memories associated with the uniform because her mama gave it to her.

00:20:33.480 --> 00:20:37.090
Okay, Nee-chan.  Can you give Yuzuyu a bath?

00:20:37.700 --> 00:20:39.470
She's been running away from me for ages.

00:20:39.730 --> 00:20:41.760
Hey, Yuzu, bath-time!

00:20:42.110 --> 00:20:43.250
No!

00:20:44.320 --> 00:20:47.020
Okay, leave it to me!

00:20:48.090 --> 00:20:51.990
Yuzuyu-chan, I'm going to take a bubble bath!

00:20:52.370 --> 00:20:53.050
What?

00:20:54.030 --> 00:20:55.090
A bubble bath?

00:20:55.320 --> 00:20:57.500
Yeah, do you want to join me?

00:20:58.360 --> 00:20:59.500
I'll come too!

00:21:01.240 --> 00:21:02.420
It's going to get in my eyes!

00:21:02.840 --> 00:21:04.880
You have to keep your eyes closed.

00:21:05.120 --> 00:21:05.620
Okay.

00:21:07.690 --> 00:21:09.680
Come on... close your eyes...

00:21:11.420 --> 00:21:13.780
Nee-chan, you're going to get heat exhaustion.

00:21:18.640 --> 00:21:23.100
Once Miyako comes back, she may go back to her old school.

00:21:35.560 --> 00:21:37.130
I'm feeling a little dizzy.

00:21:37.240 --> 00:21:38.610
Let's see...

00:21:38.800 --> 00:21:39.650
Me too!

00:21:39.850 --> 00:21:42.150
Okay, here's some juice then.

00:21:42.740 --> 00:21:43.540
Yay!

00:21:48.230 --> 00:21:48.860
It's good!

00:21:49.020 --> 00:21:49.740
Delicious!

00:23:48.770 --> 00:23:50.040
Okay, go on!

00:23:50.620 --> 00:23:51.200
Okay!

00:23:54.600 --> 00:23:57.540
Yuzuyu-chan, you're wearing a new uniform.

00:23:57.890 --> 00:23:58.260
Yep.

00:24:07.320 --> 00:24:09.290
That looks pretty good on you.

00:24:19.140 --> 00:24:21.010
One, two.  One, two.

00:24:21.260 --> 00:24:23.310
What is it Yuzuyu?  What are you doing?

00:24:23.630 --> 00:24:25.050
It's almost time for the athletics competition.

00:24:25.260 --> 00:24:27.730
Wow!  That sounds like fun!

00:24:27.930 --> 00:24:30.110
I'm not good at marching.

00:24:30.210 --> 00:24:32.660
Marching?  Leave it to me!

00:24:32.980 --> 00:24:33.930
What are you going to do?

00:24:34.050 --> 00:24:34.860
Just you watch.

00:24:35.250 --> 00:24:37.830
One, two, three, four, five, six...

00:24:37.830 --> 00:24:38.570
No!

00:24:38.820 --> 00:24:40.190
You're off from everyone else!

00:24:40.380 --> 00:24:41.550
Really?

00:24:42.330 --> 00:24:44.070
Next time on Aishiteruze Baby:

00:24:44.300 --> 00:24:45.850
One, Two!  Pudding!

00:24:46.050 --> 00:24:47.140
Let's try our best!
